@startuml activity-introduce-until-quality
title Introduce inconsistency — until target γ (method: until_quality)

note right
  Other introduction methods:
  duplicate_flip (fixed k),
  drop_attributes — see activity-introduce.puml
end note

|User|
start
:Select a dataset;
:Set target quality γ*\nand random seed;
:Start introduction;

|System|
:Compute current γ;

while (γ > γ*) is (yes)
  :Pick a random row\n(seeded RNG);
  :Append duplicate with\na different decision;
  :Recompute γ;
endwhile (no)

:Save as new dataset\n(linked to original);
:Record achieved γ;

|User|
:Review new dataset\n(γ actual ≤ γ*, often slightly lower);
stop

@enduml
